      ],
      "description": "One photographic interior view of the same empty radio room as the first reference. Close the exterior hatch fully. Fill the ENTIRE doorway opening on the left with the opaque blue-grey steel door leaf, flush inside its frame, horizontal silver latch engaged. An uninterrupted steel surface covers the threshold from top to floor. No daylight or snow around the door. The only snow visible is through the frosted window on the right. Keep the birch radio desk, practical lamp and room proportions from the first reference. Show one room, no panels, no people."
