      "label": "Radio room with fully latched door",
      "parent": null,
      "references": [
        "door",
        "workstation"
      ],
      "description": "Wide frontal photograph from inside an empty polar station. Left wall has a fully closed flush steel hatch: an opaque rectangular blue steel panel with latch, all four edges seated snugly in its steel jamb. Right wall has a birch radio desk, amber practical lamp, radio equipment and a frosted window. Continuous dry interior floor from left to right. Snow visible through window glass only. Single finished photographic room."
